<title>USA: CME Feb, March pork bellies limit up as funds buy.</title>
<headline>CME Feb, March pork bellies limit up as funds buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CME February and March pork belly futures rose the three-cent-a-lb limit in late trade, boosted by fund buying, floor sources said.</p>
<p>They noted E.D. and F. Man International and LIT were noted buyers of February.</p>
<p>At 1250 CDT February was bid the three cent limit up at 75.150 cents.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
